@startuml 05a-component-current
title Single-cluster state (post Phase 1-3) — anchor for federation diff

skinparam defaultFontName Menlo
skinparam component {
    BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
    BorderColor Black
}

package "Super6c #1 (ivalice)" {
    node "dalmasca (head)" {
        [slurmctld]
        [slurmdbd (optional)]
        [munge (key_A)]
        [nfs-server]
        [/srv/ivalice/\nsphinx-asr]
    }

    node "archadia (worker)" as W1 {
        [slurmd] as S1
        [munge_A] as M1
        [nfs4 mount] as N1
    }

    node "rozarria (worker)" as W2 {
        [slurmd] as S2
        [munge_A] as M2
        [nfs4 mount] as N2
    }

    node "bhujerba, nabradia, kerwon" as WN {
        [slurmd x3] as SN
        [munge_A x3] as MN
    }
}

cloud "Private /24\n(airgap)" as Net

dalmasca --> Net
W1 --> Net
W2 --> Net
WN --> Net

note right of dalmasca
  Single source of truth. Operator SSHes here,
  runs `sphinx …`, watches Slurm schedule on
  locally-attached workers.
end note

note bottom of Net
  **Limitations — drive the federation case:**
  - Only one cluster can work on an experiment at a time.
  - Every experiment's artifacts live on this head's NFS;
    another cluster would need a copy (manual scp).
  - No cross-team identity or sharing semantics.
end note

@enduml
